148
00:15:02,174 --> 00:15:05,124
右目にコネクター繋ぐ動力
the power connecting to my right eye—

149
00:15:05,124 --> 00:15:08,024
乱れ乱れこの温度で全て溶けるような
Disintegrate, melt away completely in this heat!

150
00:15:08,024 --> 00:15:10,524
飛ばせ飛ばせホログラムで悲しみの世界へ
Broadcast it through holograms into a world of sorrow.

151
00:15:10,824 --> 00:15:14,224
そして操られる そして操られる その世界に何が見える?
And being manipulated... What can you see in that world?

152
00:15:14,224 --> 00:15:18,524
異常な思考回路ノイズを 人類はそう…それを「愛」とまだ呼んでいる
Abnormal neural noise— humanity still calls that "love"...

153
00:15:18,524 --> 00:15:23,524
その「愛」を生みながら愛し合う世界では 「愛が与えられない者はいない」と
In a world where people love while breeding that "love", they say "No one goes without love given."

154
00:15:23,524 --> 00:15:26,524
繰り返す歴史をインストールして
Installing repeating history,

155
00:15:26,524 --> 00:15:29,824
青白く濁れ 響く雷鳴
growing pale and murky as thunder echoes.

156
00:15:30,024 --> 00:15:35,024
繋げ繋げこのコードで 争いの世界へ
Connect with this code, into a world of conflict!

157
00:15:35,024 --> 00:15:40,024
染まれ染まれパラサイトで 血液の中まで
Be dyed by parasites, right down to the blood!

158
00:15:40,024 --> 00:15:43,024
そして何が見える? そして何が見える?
And what can you see? And what can you see?

159
00:15:43,024 --> 00:15:45,024
それは空を砕く光
It is the light that shatters the sky.

160
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:12,780
え、お送りいただきましたのは、違う、お聞きいただきましたのは、
Ah, the song you just listened to...

161
00:16:12,780 --> 00:16:19,370
え、ヒビカセ、ロミオとシンデレラ、そしてジッタードールでございました。
was Hibikase, Romeo and Cinderella, and Jitter Doll!

162
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:22,530
ということで、みんな、へい、コンカナター、
And with that, everyone, hey! It's ConKanata!

163
00:16:22,530 --> 00:16:30,030
キャットコピーは握力50kg、握り潰すぞ。
My grip strength is 50kg, I'll crush you!

164
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:34,230
あまねかなた3周年記念ライブに、お越しくださりありがとうございます。
Thank you so much for coming to Amane Kanata's 3rd Anniversary Live!

165
00:16:34,230 --> 00:16:40,130
是非ね、ハッシュタグでツイート、一般してください。たくさんね、あのスクショとかも待っておりますので、
Please tweet with the hashtag and post lots of screenshots too,

166
00:16:40,130 --> 00:16:43,030
ぜひよろしくお願いします。
so we'd really appreciate it!

167
00:16:43,030 --> 00:16:50,030
はい、あの非常にね、視聴の激しい、あまねかなた3周年記念ライブの、の別世界ということで、別世界、別世界です、覚えて帰ってください。
Yes, this is a "different world" from Amane Kanata's intense 3rd anniversary live, so remember that!

168
00:16:50,030 --> 00:16:54,030
ということでですね、ちょっとお着替えをしたいと思います。
With that said, I'm going to go change my clothes for a bit.

169
00:16:54,030 --> 00:16:57,330
みらいだね、やだやだ、みえちゃだめだってば！あ！
The future? No way, no way, you can't look! Ah!

170
00:16:57,330 --> 00:17:02,030
ああ、バーチャルって簡単だなということで、このままどんどん経っていきたいと思います。
Ah, being virtual is so easy, so I want to keep going like this.

171
00:17:02,030 --> 00:17:11,030
それでは次の曲はですね、歌ってみたでも投稿している、みんなの大好きな、キンキンになるあの曲です！では聞いてください、テレキャスタービーボーイ！
Now, the next song is one I posted a cover of, everyone's favorite high-energy song! So please listen to Telecaster B-Boy!

172
00:17:26,462 --> 00:17:28,552
大人になるほどDeDeDe
The older you get, DeDeDe,

173
00:17:28,552 --> 00:17:30,652
はみ出しものは仮藍堂
outcasts are just out of place.

174
00:17:30,652 --> 00:17:32,452
人生論者が語った
A life theorist spoke,

175
00:17:32,452 --> 00:17:35,024
少女は鳥になって
and the girl turned into a bird.

176
00:17:35,024 --> 00:17:37,024
綺麗事だけでPaPaPa
Filled with empty platitudes, PaPaPa,

177
00:17:37,024 --> 00:17:39,024
ボロボロの靴を結んで
tying tattered shoes together.

178
00:17:39,024 --> 00:17:41,024
デジタル信者が崇拝した
Digital believers worshipped,

179
00:17:41,024 --> 00:17:43,024
少年は風になって
and the boy turned into the wind.

180
00:17:43,024 --> 00:17:47,024
ゆらりくらり大往生 お疲れ様です御臨終
Swaying gently into a peaceful end— rest in peace, game over.

181
00:17:52,324 --> 00:17:55,024
テレキャスタービーボーイ 僕に愛情を
Telecaster B-Boy, give me affection!

182
00:17:55,024 --> 00:18:00,024
嘘で固めたホワイアイニー うざったいんだジガーガール 魅惑ハイテンション
Wire-Iny built on lies, you're annoying, Jigger Girl, with your alluring high tension.

183
00:18:00,024 --> 00:18:07,524
カニバリズム踊れば 一つ二つ殺めた手で 何を描いているんだろう
If you dance to cannibalism, what are you drawing with hands that killed one or two?

184
00:18:08,024 --> 00:18:11,024
テレキャスタービーボーイ 僕に愛情を
Telecaster B-Boy, give me affection!

185
00:18:11,024 --> 00:18:13,524
誰か答えてくれないか
Won't someone answer me?

186
00:18:24,024 --> 00:18:26,524
乱れがとうやらDeDeDe
Wandering astray, DeDeDe,

187
00:18:26,524 --> 00:18:29,024
捨てる場合をササイスティック
tossing things aside with a sasai stick.

188
00:18:29,024 --> 00:18:31,524
六畳間もっと強く歌った
Singing even louder in a six-tatami room,

189
00:18:31,524 --> 00:18:34,024
少女は花になって
the girl turned into a flower.

190
00:18:34,024 --> 00:18:36,024
指を塞いでもPaPaPa
Even blocking my fingers, PaPaPa,

191
00:18:36,024 --> 00:18:39,024
奴らの声は花になって
their voices bloomed into flowers.

192
00:18:39,024 --> 00:18:42,024
胸に刺さったあの言葉
That phrase pierced right through my chest,

193
00:18:42,024 --> 00:18:45,024
少年は振り返って
and the boy looked back.

194
00:18:45,024 --> 00:18:49,024
ゆらりくらり大妄想 お互い様です御臨終
Swaying in grand delusion— we're both done for, rest in peace.

195
00:18:50,024 --> 00:18:55,024
テレキャスタービーボーイ 僕に愛情を ノイズまじりのホワイアイニー
Telecaster B-Boy, give me affection, Wire-Iny mixed with static!

196
00:18:55,024 --> 00:19:01,024
ジレット大惨事が揺udan禁物 頬に溶けた波を忘れたくて咽を締めた
Gillette's catastrophe— negligence forbidden. Wanting to forget the waves melting on my cheeks, I choked my throat.

197
00:19:01,024 --> 00:19:05,524
過去に遺した傷あと
Scars left behind in the past...

198
00:19:06,024 --> 00:19:10,524
テレキャスタービーボーイ 僕に愛情を 今だけ抱いてくれないか
Telecaster B-Boy, give me affection, won't you hold me just for now?

199
00:19:22,024 --> 00:19:27,024
こんな世界じゃもう息ができなくて さよなら告げた現実に
In a world like this, I can't even breathe anymore, bidding farewell to reality.

200
00:19:27,024 --> 00:19:31,024
許してくれないか 弱い僕らは またどこかで出逢いましょう
Won't you forgive us? We weak ones shall meet again somewhere.

201
00:19:34,024 --> 00:19:39,024
テレキャスタービーボーイ 僕に愛情を 嘘で固めたホワイアイニー
Telecaster B-Boy, give me affection, Wire-Iny built on lies!

202
00:19:39,024 --> 00:19:44,024
うざったいんだジガーガール 魅惑ハイテンション カニバリズム踊れば
You're annoying, Jigger Girl, with your alluring high tension. If you dance to cannibalism,

203
00:19:44,024 --> 00:19:49,524
一つ二つ殺めた手で 何を描いているんだろう
what are you drawing with hands that killed one or two?

204
00:19:49,524 --> 00:19:55,024
テレキャスタービーボーイ 僕に愛情を 誰か答えてくれないか パルラルラ
Telecaster B-Boy, give me affection, won't someone answer me? Par-la-la-la.

205
00:20:20,256 --> 00:20:24,506
朝目覚めて 真っ先に思い浮かぶ 君のこと
I wake up in the morning, and immediately I think of you.

206
00:20:24,816 --> 00:20:29,026
思い切って 前髪を切った
I boldly cut my bangs.

207
00:20:29,166 --> 00:20:31,456
「どうしたの？」って 聞かれたくて
Wanting you to ask, "What's wrong?"

208
00:20:31,726 --> 00:20:35,006
ピンクのスカート お花の髪飾り
A pink skirt, a floral hair ornament,

209
00:20:35,186 --> 00:20:36,986
さして出かけるの
and stepping out.

210
00:20:37,226 --> 00:20:41,256
今日の私は かわいいのよ！
Today I'm so cute!

211
00:20:42,856 --> 00:20:45,366
メルト 溶けてしまいそう
Melt, I'm about to melt,

212
00:20:45,576 --> 00:20:49,056
好きだなんて 絶対にいえない……だけど
I love you, I can never say it... but

213
00:20:49,236 --> 00:20:51,656
メルト 目も合わせられない
Melt, I can't even look you in the eye.

214
00:20:51,836 --> 00:20:53,976
恋に恋なんてしないわ わたし
I'm not into silly things like love,

215
00:20:54,136 --> 00:20:57,176
だって 君のことが……好きなの
Because you are... my favorite.

216
00:20:58,776 --> 00:21:01,476
天気予報が ウソをついた
The weather forecast lied,

217
00:21:01,656 --> 00:21:03,986
土砂降りの雨が降る
A torrential downpour begins to fall.

218
00:21:04,276 --> 00:21:07,426
カバンに入れたままの オリタタミ傘うれしくない
My folding umbrella still in my bag, I'm not happy.

219
00:21:07,606 --> 00:21:09,006
ためいきをついた
I let out a sigh.

220
00:21:09,206 --> 00:21:11,926
そんなとき 「しょうがないから入ってやる」なんて
At a time like that, saying "Well, I guess I'll let you in"

221
00:21:12,196 --> 00:21:15,056
隣にいる きみが笑う
You, standing right beside me, smile.

222
00:21:15,256 --> 00:21:18,056
恋に落ちる音がした
That was the sound of falling in love.

223
00:21:18,356 --> 00:21:20,766
メルト 息が詰まりそう
Melt, I feel like I'm running out of breath.

224
00:21:20,976 --> 00:21:24,506
君に触れてる右手震える
My right hand touching you is trembling.

225
00:21:24,796 --> 00:21:27,616
高鳴る胸はぱんぱんの傘
My racing heart is like a bursting umbrella.

226
00:21:27,816 --> 00:21:31,316
手を伸ばせば届く距離 どうしよう……！
Just an arm's reach away, what should I do...!

227
00:21:31,516 --> 00:21:34,576
想いよ届け 君に
May my feelings reach you, my love.

228
00:21:34,776 --> 00:21:37,836
お願い時間を止めて 泣きそうなの
Please, stop time, I feel like crying,

229
00:21:38,036 --> 00:21:42,366
でも嬉しくて死んでしまうわ！
Yet I'm so happy I could die!

230
00:21:48,276 --> 00:21:50,836
メルト
Melt,

231
00:21:51,036 --> 00:21:54,056
駅に着いてしまう……
We're about to arrive at the station...

232
00:21:54,256 --> 00:21:57,276
もう会えない 近くて遠いよ だから
We can't meet anymore, close yet so far, so

233
00:21:57,476 --> 00:22:00,676
メルト 手をつないで歩きたい！
Melt, I want to walk hand in hand with you!

234
00:22:00,876 --> 00:22:03,476
もうバイバイしなくちゃいけないの？
Do we already have to say bye-bye?

235
00:22:03,676 --> 00:22:07,176
今すぐ わたしを抱きしめて！
Hold me tight right now!

236
00:22:07,376 --> 00:22:09,176
なんてね
Or something like that.

237
00:22:37,456 --> 00:22:40,416
想いよ届け 君に
May my feelings reach you, my love.

238
00:22:40,616 --> 00:22:43,656
お願い時間を止めて 泣きそうなの
Please, stop time, I feel like crying,

239
00:22:43,856 --> 00:22:47,316
でも嬉しくて死んでしまうわ！
Yet I'm so happy I could die!

240
00:22:48,116 --> 00:22:51,076
メルト 駅に着いてしまう……
Melt, we're about to arrive at the station...

241
00:22:51,276 --> 00:22:54,276
もう会えない 近くて遠いよ だから
We can't meet anymore, close yet so far, so

242
00:22:54,476 --> 00:22:57,576
メルト 手をつないで歩きたい！
Melt, I want to walk hand in hand with you!

243
00:22:57,776 --> 00:23:00,376
もうバイバイしなくちゃいけないの？
Do we already have to say bye-bye?

244
00:23:00,576 --> 00:23:03,976
今すぐ わたしを抱きしめて！
Hold me tight right now!

245
00:23:04,176 --> 00:23:05,976
なんてね
Or something like that.

246
00:23:37,396 --> 00:23:41,556
メルト 溶けてしまいそう 好きだなんて絶対に言えない……だけど
Melt, I'm about to melt, I can never say I love you... but

247
00:23:41,756 --> 00:23:45,356
メルト 目も合わせられない 恋に恋なんてしないわ わたし
Melt, I can't even look you in the eye, I'm not into silly love

248
00:23:45,556 --> 00:23:48,556
だって 君のことが……好きなの
Because you are... my favorite.

249
00:23:49,156 --> 00:23:53,356
メルト 手をつないで歩きたい！ もうバイバイしなくちゃいけないの？
Melt, I want to walk hand in hand! Must we say bye-bye?

250
00:23:53,556 --> 00:23:57,156
今すぐ わたしを抱きしめて！ なんてね
Hold me tight right now! Or something like that.

251
00:23:59,956 --> 00:24:04,756
今すぐ 私を抱きしめて！ なんてね
Hold me tight right now! Or something like that.

252
00:24:53,876 --> 00:24:57,176
本能が狂い始める
Instinct begins to go crazy,

253
00:24:57,376 --> 00:25:00,032
追い詰められたハツカネズミ
A cornered field mouse.

254
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:02,540
本能が狂い始める
Instincts begin to go wild,

255
00:25:02,540 --> 00:25:05,840
追い詰められたハチカネバミ
driven to the edge of a railway crossing.

256
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:06,640
今、絶望の淵に立って
Now, standing in the abyss of despair,

257
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:08,840
踏み切りへと飛び出した
I leaped out beyond the crossing.

258
00:25:08,840 --> 00:25:09,340
そう、君は友達
Yes, you're my friend,

259
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:13,340
僕の手を掴めよ
take my hand.

260
00:25:13,340 --> 00:25:13,940
そう、君は独りさ
Yes, you're all alone,

261
00:25:16,140 --> 00:25:18,940
居場所なんて無いだろ
you've got nowhere to belong, right?

262
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:20,340
二人きりこのまま
Just the two of us alone,

263
00:25:22,540 --> 00:25:25,540
愛し合えたら―。
if we could love each other...

264
00:25:26,340 --> 00:25:27,540
繰り返す
Repeating,

265
00:25:27,540 --> 00:25:30,040
フラッシュバック・蝉の声・
a flashback, the sound of cicadas...

266
00:25:30,540 --> 00:25:33,940
二度とは帰らぬ君
and you, who will never return,

267
00:25:33,940 --> 00:25:37,340
永遠に千切れてく
torn apart for all eternity.

268
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:39,940
お揃いのキーホルダー
Our matching keychains,

269
00:25:39,940 --> 00:25:43,340
夏が消し去った
the summer erased them,

270
00:25:43,340 --> 00:25:46,440
白い肌の少女に
the girl with the pale skin.

271
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:52,540
哀しい程に取り憑かれて仕舞いたい
I want to be possessed by her to the point of tears.

272
00:26:05,840 --> 00:26:06,340
本性が暴れ始める
True nature starts to run wild,

273
00:26:06,340 --> 00:26:09,140
九月のスタート 告げるチャイム
September's start, the warning chime.

274
00:26:09,140 --> 00:26:12,140
次の標的に置かれた花瓶
The vase placed as the next target—

275
00:26:14,340 --> 00:26:17,340
仕掛けたのは僕だった
the one who set it up was me.

276
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:18,840
そう、君が悪いんだよ
Yes, you're the one to blame,

277
00:26:18,840 --> 00:26:21,040
僕だけを見ててよ
just look at me.

278
00:26:21,040 --> 00:26:24,040
そう、君の苦しみ
Yes, your suffering—

279
00:26:24,540 --> 00:26:27,440
助けが欲しいだろ
you must want help, right?

280
00:26:28,140 --> 00:26:30,940
溺れてくその手に
Drowning in that hand,

281
00:26:31,940 --> 00:26:37,040
そっとキスをした―。
I gently gave a kiss...

282
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:42,540
薄笑いの獣たち
Those faint-smiling beasts,

283
00:26:42,540 --> 00:26:45,540
そのこころ晴れるまで
until their hearts clear up,

284
00:26:45,540 --> 00:26:49,040
爪を突き立てる
they sharpen their claws.

285
00:26:49,140 --> 00:26:52,240
不揃いのスカート
Mismatched skirts,

286
00:26:52,240 --> 00:26:58,240
夏の静寂を切り裂くような悲鳴が
a cry that tears through the summer silence

287
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:04,240
こだまする
echoes away.

288
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:04,940
教室の窓には青空
Outside the classroom window is a blue sky.

289
00:27:16,840 --> 00:27:18,040
君は友達
Yes, you're my friend,

290
00:27:32,440 --> 00:27:34,040
僕の手を掴めよ
take my hand.

291
00:27:34,040 --> 00:27:34,540
そう、君は独りさ
Yes, you're all alone,

292
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:39,040
居場所なんて無いんだよ
you've got nowhere to belong, right?

293
00:27:40,040 --> 00:27:45,040
透き通った世界で愛し合えたら―。
In a transparent world, if we could love each other...

294
00:27:50,040 --> 00:27:53,040
繰り返す フラッシュバック・蝉の声・
Repeating, a flashback, the sound of cicadas...

295
00:27:55,040 --> 00:27:58,040
二度とは帰らぬ君
and you, who will never return,

296
00:27:58,040 --> 00:28:02,040
永遠に千切れてく
torn apart for all eternity.

297
00:28:02,040 --> 00:28:05,040
お揃いのキーホルダー
Our matching keychains,

298
00:28:05,040 --> 00:28:09,040
夏が消し去った
the summer erased them,

299
00:28:09,040 --> 00:28:14,040
白い肌の少女に
the girl with the pale skin.

300
00:28:14,040 --> 00:28:21,040
哀しい程に取り憑かれて仕舞いたい
I want to be possessed by her to the point of tears.

301
00:28:21,040 --> 00:28:26,040
透明な君は僕を指差してた
Transparent you pointed at me,

302
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:31,040
少女レイ
Shojo Rei

303
00:29:30,040 --> 00:29:34,040
「昨日人殺しなんだ」
"I killed someone yesterday."

304
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:36,040
君はそう言っていた
You said that,

305
00:29:36,040 --> 00:29:41,040
梅雨時ずぶ濡れのまんま 部屋の前で泣いていた
soaking wet in the rainy season, crying in front of the room.

306
00:29:41,040 --> 00:29:46,040
夏が始まったばかりというのに 君はひどく震えていた
